  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education to peaceful cohabitatio between the local communities of the Diocese of BUBANZA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is to sensitize members of local communities to peaceful coexistence  by cohabitation education sessions . It will also raise awareness on the value and importance of the elections as being a popular choice and one of the models of democracy.
Activities to be conducted are the following :
1. Workshops training in peaceful cohabitation and peaceful resolution of conflicts 2. Training workshops in monitoring and electoral observation; 3. Training in monitoring and observation of human rights. 4. Two visits for the exchange of experience in 2 border dioceses (BUKAVU in DRC) and CYANGUGU in the RWANDA</narrative>
  </description>
